_pdbx_soln_scatter_model.details                        
;THE DEPOSITED STRUCTURE CONTAINS          
ONLY CA ATOMS. THE IGM COORDINATES ARE PROVIDED FROM AN EARLY       
STUDY IN WHICH A MANUAL FIT METHOD BASED ON KNOWN CRYSTAL           
STRUCTURES FOR IGG WAS USED TO DETERMINE STRUCTURES FOR INTACT      
IGM AND ITS FAB, FAB'2, FC5 AND IGM-S MONOMER SUBUNITS. THESE       
CRYSTAL STRUCTURES ORIGINATED FROM HUMAN FAB KOL (PDB CODE          
2FB4) AND HUMAN FC (PDB CODE 1FC1). THIS PROCEDURE IS               
APPROXIMATE AND THE IGM MODEL IS NOT CONSIDERED TO BE OPTIMAL       
OR REFINED AGAINST THE X-RAY SCATTERING DATA.
;
